      "content": "i dont want to talk about professionals or friends. they arent here. they wont be here when the doors give way. i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i could just decide how it ends. to have some kind of dignity left instead of just being caught in the middle of all that horror. it feels like the only thing i can actually control is how i face the end.",
